@M_KOJO_EN01_COLOR_K119

;ここでSETCOLORすることで口上に色を付けられます
;You can use SETCOLOR to change the color of a character's dialogue.
;例：SETCOLOR 0xC07070
SETCOLOR 0xC6D3E0

;added
;Your character's profile goes here.
@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_EN01_K119()
CALL M_KOJO_EN01_COLOR_K119
PRINTFORMDL %nameArray:119:na_Title%
RESETCOLOR
PRINTL 
PRINTFORML Dialogue v{CFLAG:119:K119EN_FLAG_VER / 1000}.{CFLAG:119:K119EN_FLAG_VER / 100}.{CFLAG:119:K119EN_FLAG_VER % 100}
PRINTL
PRINTFORMDL An elderly yamanba who lives alone on Youkai Mountain.
PRINTFORMDL Like all yamanba, she has little interest in the world outside her sanctuary, 
PRINTFORMDL preferring to keep to herself and form non-aggression pacts with the other races of 
PRINTFORMDL the mountain, like the kappa and tengu.
PRINTL 
PRINTFORMDL Despite her fearsome demeanor, Nemuno is actually a compassionate woman.
PRINTFORMDL If a traveler gets lost in her territory, she will politely but firmly escort them 
PRINTFORMDL home, and if she finds an orphaned child on the mountain, she will raise them as 
PRINTFORMDL her own. Nemuno would like to have children of her own one day, but she 
PRINTFORMDL believes that she is too old and ugly to ever find a 
PRINTFORMDL %PRINT_MALE("husband", MASTER)%.
RETURN 1

