;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"ENCOUNTER" events (extra syntax)
;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;First Meeting
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_EN01_ENCOUNTER_K119
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;経験の変更は齟齬が出る場合がありますので、CSVを修正し同梱する事を推奨します
IF IS_CHILD(MASTER)
ELSE
	IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == 736 || (MAIN_MAP != 7 && CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == 770)
		IF TALENT:MASTER:妖怪 == 5 || TALENT:MASTER:水棲 ;Tengu or Kappa
			PRINTFORML 「HEY! I thought I told you lot t'stay the hell outta my territory!」
			PRINTFORMDW You turn to see an angry-looking elderly woman waving a cleaver at you.
			PRINTFORMW 「D'y'think y'can take advantage o'me just 'cause I'm a yamanba?!」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'll skin you alive an' have yer skin hung up on my door as a warnin'!」
			PRINTFORMDW What will you do?
			PRINTFORMDL
			CALL ASK_M("Fight!", ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > 0, "Run!", 1, "Grovel!", 1)
			SELECTCASE RESULT
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORMDW You don't know what this woman's talking about, but you're not going to let her push you around!
					PRINTFORMDW You hover into the air and pull out a Spell Card...
					PRINTFORMDW .....
					PRINTFORMDW ...
					PRINTFORMDW .
					IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:119:戦闘能力
						PRINTFORMDW The woman sinks to one knee, breathing heavily and covered in cuts and bruises.
						PRINTFORMDW But she has a grin on her face.
						PRINTFORMW 「You... yer a strong 'un.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Just who are ya?」
						PRINTFORMDW You give your name.
						PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, eh? I'll remember that.」
						PRINTFORMW 「What're ya doin' in my territory, anyway?」
						PRINTFORMDW You explain, and Nemuno's jaw drops.
						PRINTFORMW 「Yer tellin' me yer from the Outside an' y'didn't know 'bout our non-aggression pact?!」
						PRINTFORMW 「Well, now I feel like a real jerk.」
						$IS_OUTSIDER
						PRINTFORMW 「Come to my place. I'll make you some tea and a meal.」
						PRINTFORMDW She grabs your hand and marches off with you in tow.
						PRINTFORMDW .....
						PRINTFORMDW ...
						PRINTFORMDW .
						PRINTFORMDW Nemuno's prepared some kind of dish made of unfamiliar vegetables over wild rice.
						PRINTFORMDW It smells delicious... you take a bite, then another.
						PRINTFORMDW It tastes just as good as it smells, and you tell her so.
						PRINTFORMDW She grins at you.
						PRINTFORMW 「Glad to hear it. Not everyone's a fan o' mountain cuisine.」
						PRINTFORMDW The tea is just as good. It has an interesting taste... did she brew it with mountain herbs?
						PRINTFORMDW When you've finished eating and drinking, you thank Nemuno for her hospitality.
						PRINTFORMW 「Ah, you ain't gotta thank me. 'S the least I could do.」
						PRINTFORMW 「I'm guessin' you'll want to be on yer way now.」
						PRINTFORMDW Nemuno stands up and holds the door to her hut open for you.
						PRINTFORMDW You step out into the open air and walk until Nemuno is out of sight.
						IF MAIN_MAP != 7
							CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 = 710
						ELSE
							CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 = 701
						ENDIF
						GOTO NEMUNO_THOUGHTS
					ELSE
						PRINTFORMDW The woman stands triumphantly over your bruised and beaten body.
						PRINTFORMW 「I told ya. Next time don't try n' mess with me.」
						PRINTFORMW 「And tell yer friends to stay outta Nemuno Sakata's territory!」
					ENDIF

				CASE 1
					PRINTFORMDW You turn around and run like hell.
					PRINTFORMW 「Yeah, that's right! You'd better run!」
					PRINTFORMW 「And if y'know what's good fer ya, you'll stay outta Nemuno Sakata's territory!」
					IF MAIN_MAP != 7
						CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 = 710
					ELSE
						CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 = 701
					ENDIF
					MARK:119:反発刻印 = 2

				CASE 2
					PRINTFORMDW Screw dignity. You don't like the look of that cleaver.
					PRINTFORMDW You get down on your hands and knees and plead that you had no idea you were trespassing.
					PRINTFORMW 「Did ya, now?」
					PRINTFORMDW The woman puts away her cleaver and folds her arms.
					PRINTFORMW 「I distinctly remember makin' a non-aggression pact with the \@ TALENT:MASTER:妖怪 == 5 ? tengu. Didn't Iizunamaru # kappa. Didn't Kawashiro\@ tell all'a you about it?」
					CALL ASK_M("I'm from the Outside World", 1, "She didn't tell me where your territory was", 1, "...I forgot", 1)
					SELECTCASE RESULT
						CASE 0
							PRINTFORMW 「Y'... Y'are?」
							PRINTFORMDW The woman looks sheepish.
							PRINTFORMW 「What's yer name, Outsider?」
							PRINTFORMW 「...%CALLNAME:MASTER%-san, eh? I'm Nemuno Sakata. Sorry fer threatenin' ya.」
							GOTO IS_OUTSIDER

						CASE 1
							PRINTFORMW 「Well, yer about t'learn.」
							PRINTFORMDW The woman grabs your hand firmly and drags you off.
							PRINTFORMDW She takes you around the whole border of her territory until you're back where you started.
							PRINTFORMW 「There. That's Nemuno Sakata's territory. Don't forget it if y'know what's good fer ya.」
							PRINTFORMW 「Now git outta here. I've got huntin' t'do.」
							PRINTFORMDW Nemuno draws her cleaver and walks away.
							GOTO NEMUNO_LEAVES

						CASE 2
							PRINTFORMW 「You... forgot.」
							PRINTFORMDW The woman sighs.
							PRINTFORMW 「How the hell did you forget?! Are you lot not takin' me seriously?!」
							PRINTFORMW 「Maybe I should give ya a good beatin' t'change tha- oh fer cryin' out loud, stop that damn kowtowin'!」
							PRINTFORMDW You stand up and wipe some dirt off your forehead.
							PRINTFORMW 「You know what, just... get outta here.」
							PRINTFORMW 「But you'd better stay away from Nemuno Sakata's territory from now on!」

					ENDSELECT
			ENDSELECT
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Oi! This is my territory, y'know!」
			PRINTFORMDW You turn to see an angry-looking elderly woman, arms folded, glaring at you.
			PRINTFORMW 「I ain't seen ya before... you from the Outside World?」
			CALL ASK_YN()
			IF !RESULT
				PRINTFORMW 「Huh. Don't see many of you folks endin' up on Youkai Mountain.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Oh, really? Didn't yer mama teach you not to go wanderin' around in youkai territory?」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMW 「Anyway, I'm Nemuno Sakata, and this here stretch o' land's my territory.」
			PRINTFORMW 「You didn't know, so I'll let it slide, but I don't take kindly to trespassers.」
			PRINTFORMW 「If yer lost, I can escort ya t'the edge of the forest.」
			CALL ASK_YN("Yes please!", "No thanks, I can find my own way home")
			IF !RESULT
				PRINTFORMW 「Awright then, follow me.」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno sets off at a brisk pace, and you hurry to catch up with her.
				PRINTFORMDW .....
				PRINTFORMDW ...
				PRINTFORMDW .
				PRINTFORMDW Before long, you're standing outside the forest.
				IF MAIN_MAP != 7
					CFLAG:119:現在位置 = 710
					CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 = 710
				ELSE
					CFLAG:119:現在位置 = 701
					CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 = 701
				ENDIF
				PRINTFORMW 「Now be careful not t'get lost in the mountains again, y'hear?」
				PRINTFORMW 「You don't wanna know what the kappa and tengu do to humans they catch.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Damn perverts...」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Huh. Can't tell if yer brave or just a darn fool.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Well, either way, I'd best be headin' home.」
				PRINTFORMW 「If ya get kidnapped by tengu or kappa, don't say I didn't warn ya.」
			ENDIF
			$NEMUNO_LEAVES
			PRINTFORMDW Nemuno turns around and \@ CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == 736 ? heads into her hut # leaves\@.
			IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == 770
				CFLAG:119:現在位置 = 710
			ELSEIF CFLAG:119:現在位置 == 710
				CFLAG:119:現在位置 = 770
			ELSE
				CFLAG:119:現在位置 = KICKOUT()
			ENDIF
			IF TALENT:MASTER:倒錯的
				PRINTFORMDW You bite your lip to keep from wolf whistling when you see how plump her ass is.
				PRINTFORMDW And she's got some pretty big tits, too...
				PRINTFORMDW Maybe you should get to know her better.
			ELSE
				$NEMUNO_THOUGHTS
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno Sakata, huh...
				PRINTFORMDW She wasn't particularly friendly, but she didn't seem like a bad person.
				PRINTFORMDW You wonder if you'll run into her again sometime.
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「Hm? Who're you? Don't think I've seen ya 'round here before.」
		PRINTFORMDW You turn to see an elderly woman staring at you curiously.
		PRINTFORMDW You give her your name.
		PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, huh? I'm Nemuno Sakata. Nice t'meetcha.」
		PRINTFORMDW She inclines her head.
		PRINTFORMDW You wait for her to continue, but she just stares at you awkwardly.
		PRINTFORMDW Not much of a social butterfly, huh...
		PRINTFORMDW You ask her to tell her more about herself.
		PRINTFORMW 「Me? I'm a yamanba. We live up in the mountains n' keep t'ourselves.」
		PRINTFORMW 「That's about it.」
		PRINTFORMW 「And actually, I gotta get hoppin'. Nice meetin' ya, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
		GOTO NEMUNO_LEAVES
	ENDIF
ENDIF

RETURN 1

