	PRINTFORMW 「Thanks fer goin' out with me.」
	PRINTFORMDW Nemuno takes your hand and smiles at you.
	PRINTFORMW 「I can't remember the last time I had so much fun.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Actually...」
	PRINTFORMDW She stares at you and blushes.
	PRINTFORMDW You stare back. Neither of you says a word.
	PRINTFORMDW Then...
	FONTITALIC
